  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One core, two transports",
      "items": [
        "The public demo runs @safe-edge/core in the page on the labelled Elmina seed, so it needs no backend",
        "The local stack runs the same core inside the Hono REST API, with a bun:sqlite journal",
        "The SDK picks the transport: memory runs core in the page, http calls /v1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One set of agent tools",
      "items": [
        "The MCP server and the in-page agent both wrap @safe-edge/agent-tools",
        "The agent reads, proposes and drafts only; eight tools, each naming the API scope it needs",
        "Core refuses the agent every approval: approveRemedy, recordRetest and submitWorkOrder name no agent scope"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Outside the prototype",
      "items": [
        "A patrol plan exports as a DJI WPML KMZ or a QGroundControl .plan, stamped NOT FLIGHT-READY",
        "The agent calls the Anthropic API with claude-opus-5-5 and the key it is given",
        "With PROCORE_* set, a submitted work order becomes a Procore observation through @safe-edge/providers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What the diagram leaves out",
      "items": [
        "@safe-edge/perception is an empty placeholder: packages/perception/src/index.ts exports nothing",
        "@safe-edge/contracts is read by every app and package, so only one of those edges is drawn",
        "Simulated flights, detections and repairs carry simulated: true and say so on every screen"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
